import LOEIS.A353.A353178.Defs

set_option linter.unusedVariables false

/-!
# A353178

The row numbers of the Trithoff (tribonacci) array that correspond to difference sequences of other rows of the Trithoff array.

The 65 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A353178

/-- Known terms of `A353178`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [2, 3, 4, 7, 11, 12, 16, 17, 19, 20,
    21, 25, 26, 28, 29, 30, 33, 34, 35, 38,
    42, 43, 45, 46, 47, 50, 51, 52, 55, 59,
